# SIGP repository rules

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` before changing this repository. Use
`docs/README.md` to locate the relevant architecture, domain and development
documentation.

- Keep the system a modular monolith.
- Make the smallest change that satisfies the current requirement.
- Do not add planned integrations or packages until code uses them.
- Preserve employee assignment and contract history.
- Keep backend modules and frontend features within their existing workspace
  boundaries.
- Never commit secrets or personal data.
- Run `pnpm verify` after code changes.
